  "notes": "Godan verb ({五段動詞|ごだんどうし})\n- {見込|みこ}む → {見込|みこ}まない → {見込|みこ}んで → {見込|みこ}んだ\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\nTransitive verb ({他動詞|たどうし})\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- {見込|みこ}み (expectation, prospect, hope - noun form)\n- {見込|みこ}み{客|きゃく} (prospective customer)\n- {見込|みこ}み{違|ちが}い (miscalculation, wrong expectation)\n\nGRAMMATICAL PATTERNS:\n- ～を{見込|みこ}む (to expect [amount/result])\n- ～と{見込|みこ}まれる (to be expected to ~)\n- ～を{見込|みこ}んで (expecting/anticipating ~)\n\nUSAGE CONTEXT:\nSense 1 is common in business and formal contexts for forecasts and projections. Sense 2 is used when expressing trust in someone's abilities.",
